# T10.7: testmap-teleport (T5.6) played as Final Doom's first executable
# (gameversion final, Chocolate Doom's exe_final): EV_Teleport leaves the
# player's height as it was, so it falls 16 units into B (floor -16) and
# steps up 48 into A (floor 32) through P_ZMovement (the smooth step up),
# and the destination fog spawns at the old height. Same ticcmds.
